3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charm_Person\" title=\"Charm Person\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Charm_Person_Icon.webp/25px-Charm_Person_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Charm_Person_Icon.webp/38px-Charm_Person_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Charm_Person_Icon.webp/50px-Charm_Person_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charm Person\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Charm_Person_Icon.webp/25px-Charm_Person_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Charm_Person_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charm_Person\" title=\"Charm Person\">Charm Person</a> spell once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Whispers in the Deep Speech of the Underdark insinuate themselves into the mind of whoever so much as brushes against the burnished metal of this ring\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" 